1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,180
(Sheldon:)But perhaps
from your lofty heights

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,100
(Sheldon:)atop the corporate ladder,
you've lost touch

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,130
(Sheldon:)with the struggles
of the common man.

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:10,000
(Leonard:)Look, I'm still happy
to drive you to work.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,840
(Leonard:)Nothing's changed
in that regard.

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,810
(Leonard:)We're still roommates,
we're still friends.

7
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:17,240
(Sheldon:)Except you identified me,
your best friend,

8
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,750
(Sheldon:)as a gangrenous limb
that needed to be severed

9
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:21,360
(Sheldon:)from the organism
and tossed away.

10
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,320
(Sheldon:)The desperate act
of a little man

11
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,790
(Sheldon:)with a big Napoleon complex.

12
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,620
(Penny:)You know what?

13
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,920
(Leonard:)Go put on your bus pants.

14
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,480
(Raj:)Mm. Last night,
I had a dream

15
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,090
(Raj:)we got so rich from the app,

16
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,500
(Raj:)you and I bought matching
side-by-side mansions.

17
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,300
(Howard:)But...

18
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,750
(Raj:)there was a secret tunnel

19
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:51,840
(Raj:)connecting your front yard
to my back yard.

20
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:59,020
(Raj:)What do you think that means?

